; The Cyclesim leg (AGENT.md 1d): doom.blob on the cycle-accurate HardCaml
; model. The oberon-risc-hardcaml submodule (physically at the repo root's
; vendor/, reached here through the sim/vendor symlink — dune deps can't
; escape a workspace root) is its own dune project and stays PRISTINE —
; treat it as raw data; the risc5/ and nexys4/ wrapper dirs compile its
; sources into THIS project (the same copy_files pattern both repos use for
; the vendored emulator). Its vendor/ (the nested emulator submodule, now
; initialized — the main workspace's `emu` wrapper reads it) is data_only
; here, so nothing composes twice.
;
; This root builds on the OxCaml switch (hardcaml v0.18-preview):
;   opam exec --switch=5.2.0+ox -- dune build --root sim

(executable
 (name doom_sim)
 (libraries hardcaml nexys4_board risc5 unix)
 (preprocess
  (pps ppx_hardcaml)))
